{"description":"Toronto, come show your support for Toronto tech-art creators :)\nAll presenters and audience members will be eligible to win one of several special prizes, including a pair of tickets to FITC 2027 (valued at $800)!\nCreators: This is an open space for you to share what you're up to in your tech-art projects. New projects, works-in-progress, and ideas in development are all welcome. This is a gentle space to be seen and heard, a chance for you to feel supported, and get some audience (and industry) reactions.\nStick around afterwards to hear some of Toronto's top immersive experience producers, agencies, and gallerists in an industry roundtable.\nPlan to stay all night! MULTI’s Immersive Happy Hour follows at 7pm, kicking off Nuit Blanche at STACKT Market.\n10 min max per presentation.\nProjector + screen + HDMI cable available for presentations.\nPresented by MULTIfest, this special Works-In-Progress showing/sharing is hosted by Laboratory for Artistic Intelligence.","organizer":"Laboratory for Artistic Intelligence"}